# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
.venv/

# Go build output lives under gotools/ and is ignored there.

# Local hosting (deploy/). The scripts are committed; what they generate is not.
#
# The Go toolchain and module cache are NOT listed here because they no longer
# live in the tree at all — deploy/install-go.sh puts them in $DAKCODER_HOME
# (~/.local/share/dakcoder). Twenty thousand generated files inside the working
# tree slow every editor, watcher and search, and .gitignore hides them from
# git alone. Ignoring is not the same as not being there.
deploy/*.env
deploy/logs/
code-review/

# Python build artifacts. `python -m build` writes a full copy of every source
# file here, and 41 of them were committed — stale, and differing from src/.
# During one debugging session several reviewers read build/lib/ instead of
# src/, quoted line numbers that do not exist in the running code, and reported
# defects against a file nobody ships.
apps/*/build/
apps/*/*.egg-info/
error.txt
